<title>NETHERLANDS: NWE oil products start steady to firm with futures.</title>
<headline>NWE oil products start steady to firm with futures.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE oil products were steady to firm in a thin Monday start, dealers said.</p>
<p>Heating oil barges were up almost a dollar a tonne as IPE gas oil futures strengthened. Prompt barge offers were at around IPE May +$1 fob ARA, as at Friday's close.</p>
<p>High sulphur fuel oil barges were offered at $84 fob Rotterdam, a dollar up on Friday, but bids were no higher, at $82 fob.</p>
<p>Initial bunker enquiries were limited.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom, +31 20 504 5004</p>
